	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03_swchampion_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>アイリス『この　さきが　サムピア！▼
ヒウンで　あやしいと　いえば
スリムストリート　か▽
ここかなと　おもうんだ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-08T04:49:34" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アイリス『この先が　サムピア！▼
ヒウンで　怪しいと　いえば
スリムストリート　か▽
ここかなと　思うんだ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-08T04:49:41" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・c03p07イベント後
　GRIDX＝72、GRIDZ＝62に出現
・posイベント
・メッセージ表示後、c03p09方面へ移動
　画面外に消えると主人公操作可能に</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-06T08:12:26" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWCHAMPION
アイリス</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T02:56:44" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-06T08:18:05" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
