	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03_businessman1_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ベッドで　ねむりに　つくとき▼
ぼくの　ポケモンの　こうげきが
きゅうしょに　あたったとき▼
ぼくの　じんせいは　いろんな
よろこびに　あふれておるのです！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-20T07:25:48" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ベッドで　眠りに　つくとき▼
ぼくの　ポケモンの　攻撃が
きゅうしょに　あたったとき▼
ぼくの　人生は　いろんな
喜びに　あふれておるのです！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-20T07:25:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
※swanでメッセージ修正</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-20T07:25:53" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BUSINESSMAN
ビジネスマン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-06T08:18:09" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
