		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03_businessman2_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>わたしは　たたかう　ビジネスマン！
あきらめなければ　いつか　かつ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-20T07:27:09" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
