				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>私は　闘う　ビジネスマン！
あきらめなければ　いつか　勝つ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-20T07:27:03" />
